slider25:p_run=0<0,1,1{Stop,Run}>-Rhythm run
slider26:p_syn=0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Sync to REAPER tempo
slider27:p_sty=3<0,15,1{March,Waltz,Swing,8 Beat,16 Beat,Disco,Bossa,Samba,Offbeat,Slow Rock,Country,Polka,Tango,Beguine,Ballad,Pop}>-Rhythm style
